8. `root_cause_missing` — `root_cause` must be non-empty, concrete (component / config / dependency / process step), and must not be a restatement of `symptoms` or a vague "user error".
9. `fault_domain_mismatch` — `fault_domain` must be one of {hardware, software, configuration, process, billing, account, integration} and must align with the subsystem in `title` / `category` and the stated `root_cause`.
